    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7Ub9zE",
      "title": "chore: restore 074 to EXECUTED, split new rotation into 075",
      "author": "Ethnical",
      "number": 1403,
      "body": "\r\n\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n`074-deputy-pause-key-rotation` was reset to `READY TO SIGN` in #1402 to redo the DPM rotation via `FoundationUpgradeSafe` against the new DPM. That reset overwrote the authentic on-chain execution record of the original rotation ([tx `0xb5f1725e…`](https://sepolia.etherscan.io/tx/0xb5f1725e6f29081ca47e25d97e4f572e4e82dfde9678a4b9d5e45139876af8c7) on 2026-04-17, signed by `FoundationOperationsSafe` against the old DPM `0xc6f7C07…`, succeeded).\r\n\r\n\r\nI've simulated the whole pause in the fork after this execution: \r\n<img width=\"3832\" height=\"1912\" alt=\"a382d5d254265163a74b59f6c156aef1783bf080167139aa509db08b8397b7c9\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c78d5764-1909-4815-a391-7baff0370f00\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nThis PR splits the two:\r\n\r\n- **`src/tasks/sep/074-deputy-pause-key-rotation/`** — restored to the exact pre-#1402 `EXECUTED` state. Preserves the historical record of what actually landed.\r\n- **`src/tasks/sep/075-deputy-pause-key-rotation/`** — new task holding the #1402 rotation content: `FoundationUpgradeSafe`, new DPM `0xC10dAc07…`, nonce override 69. Status `READY TO SIGN`.\r\n\r\n## Fixes inherited from #1402\r\n\r\nThe post-#1402 content had several internal inconsistencies. Applied while copying into 075:\r\n\r\n1. **config.toml `stateOverrides`** target was `0x837DE4…` (FoundationOperationsSafe) — the override never actually pinned `FoundationUpgradeSafe`'s nonce. Moved to `0xDEe57160…` so the override works as intended.\r\n2. **VALIDATION.md State Overrides section** — the Etherscan link pointed at `0x837DE4…` while the header named `0xDEe57160…`. Fixed.\r\n3. **VALIDATION.md nonce-change \"Detail\" line** was a wrong copy-paste from the deputy change section. Replaced with the correct description.\r\n4. **README.md Objective / Execution / Signing sections** still named the old safe and old DPM. Updated to `FoundationUpgradeSafe` + new DPM.\r\n\r\n## Regenerated message hash\r\n\r\nWith the `stateOverride` fix, the nonce=69 pin now actually applies to `FoundationUpgradeSafe`. The VALIDATION.md message hash from #1402 (`0xe237ee9c…`) was only stable while the broken override was silently ignored and `FoundationUpgradeSafe`'s live nonce drifted. New stable hash computed under the fixed config:\r\n\r\n```\r\nDomain Hash:  0x37e1f5dd3b92a004a23589b741196c8a214629d4ea3a690ec8e41ae45c689cbb\r\nMessage Hash: 0x6f8c38c0b276d934e3eee0ce8638805238502f393b543a6ee7d523c25b888d98\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\n- [x] `bash src/script/check-task-statuses.sh` passes locally\r\n- [x] `just simulate` on 075 reproduces the Domain + Message hashes above against `FoundationUpgradeSafe` with nonce=69 pinned\r\n- [x] `just simulate` on 074 — not applicable; 074 is now `EXECUTED`, `fetch-tasks.sh` skips it\r\n\r\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
